WEBVTT

00:09:27.188 --> 00:09:30.910
In "Parable of the Sower,"
basically my Bible, she says,

00:09:30.934 --> 00:09:34.483
"All that you touch
You Change.

00:09:34.507 --> 00:09:37.790
All that you Change
Changes you.

00:09:37.814 --> 00:09:41.750
The only lasting truth
Is Change.

00:09:41.774 --> 00:09:44.180
God
Is Change."

00:09:44.204 --> 00:09:48.561
It's time for these 50 states to change.

00:09:48.585 --> 00:09:52.820
What got us here sure as hell
won't get us there.

00:09:52.844 --> 00:09:55.129
We've got to kick the walls of power down

00:09:55.153 --> 00:09:59.745
and plant gardens of genuine
democracy in their place.

00:09:59.769 --> 00:10:02.547
That's how we change systems.